        "author": "Palickap",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected2016 west facade: pale cream ashlar fortress-like basilica, high central gable and lower sloped shoulders, three doors with gabled central prothyron, small paired rounded windows/oculus and blind cornice arches. Unequal square west towers: north low/flat, south higher with a large open round belfry. Exact sculpture/reliefs excluded."
