        "author": "Palickap",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected2016 south side: deep lower six-bay round-arched recesses, narrow inner windows and doorway. Upper gallery groups of small round arches on slender columns, blind small arches under cornice. Tall eastern transept south gable, paired high windows, oculus and lower blind arcade. Tiled roofs and broad plain masonry; exact vehicles/parking/rails excluded."
      },
      {
