        "author": "Enric",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected2021 east elevation: flat rectangular stone exterior, NOT projecting semicircular apses. Large central deeply framed barred round-head window, symmetrical paired windows high/around, lower blind arches/pilasters and narrow slits. Attached neighboring fabric excluded."
